# The image build context is an allow-list: anything not named below is never
# sent to the builder, so a local .env, an API token, a virtualenv or a test
# fixture cannot end up in an image by accident.
*

!pyproject.toml
!alembic.ini
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!migrations/
!personalos/
!apps/
!mcp_servers/
!docs/quickstart/

# Even inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/api-token
